# Ordo needs no environment variables and no external services to run. Everything is stored in the browser.
#
# Optional: privacy-first page-view counting. Leave both lines commented for no analytics at all.
# If you turn it on, also add the script's host to `script-src` and `connect-src` in vercel.json,
# otherwise the browser will (correctly) refuse to load it. Visitors who send Do Not Track or
# Global Privacy Control are never counted.
#
# VITE_ANALYTICS_DOMAIN=your-site.example
# VITE_ANALYTICS_SRC=https://plausible.io/js/script.js
